<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-SCHALKE 1 INTERNAZIONALE 0 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCHALKE 1 INTERNAZIONALE 0 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>GELSENKIRCHEN, Germany 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schalke of Germany beat Internazionale Milan of Italy 1-0 on Wednesday in the first leg of the UEFA Cup final.</p>
<p>Scorer: Marc Wilmots 70</p>
<p>Halftime 0-0</p>
<p>Attendance: 56,824</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>Schalke - 1-Jens Lehmann, 10-Olaf Thon, 25-Johan de Kock, 2-Thomas Linke, 3-Radoslav Latal, 4-Yves Eigenrauch, 6-Andreas Mueller, 20-Jiri Nemec, 19-Michael Bueskens (11-Martin Max 68), 8-Ingo Anderbruegge, 24-Marc Wilmots</p>
<p>Internazionale - 1-Gianluca Pagliuca, 2-Giuseppe Bergomi, 5-Fabio Galante, 19-Massimo Paganin, 3-Alessandro Pistone, 4- Javier Zanetti, 21-Ciriaco Sforza, 7-Salvatore Fresi (18-Nicola Berti 60), 14-Aron Winter, 23-Maurizio Ganz, 9-Ivan Zamorano</p>
<p>Referee: Marc Batta (France).</p>
